A series of variations of Theorem~\ref{dirac} for Berge cycles in a number of classes of %$r$-uniform hypergraphs ({\em
  $r$-graphs were obtained by
Bermond,  Germa,  Heydemann and Sotteau~\cite{BGHS}, Clemens, Ehrenm\"uller and Person~\cite{CEP},
