\begin{proof} We will prove (i). If $j\neq i$, then we can replace the segment of $C$ from $e_i$ to $e_j$ containing $|j-i|$ vertices with the path $e_j, u_{\ell}, P[u_{\ell}, u_q], u_q, e_i$ which contains $\ell-q + 1$ vertices. The new cycle  cannot be longer than $C$, thus (ii) holds. The proofs for (ii) and (iii) are similar so we omit them.
\end{proof}





