$u_m,f_m,u_{m+1},\ldots,u_{\ell}$ with the subpath $u_m,g,u_{\ell},f_{\ell-1},u_{\ell-1},\ldots,u_{m+1}$, then $(C,P'_{m+1})$ also is a $j$-good lollipop or dcp-pair.
