 Consider the 2-connected incidence graph $I_H$ of $H$ and the (graph) path
  \[P' = v_1, e_1, v_2, \ldots, v_c, f_0,u_1, \ldots, f_{\ell}, u_{\ell}\] in $I_H$. 
