If $f_{g-1} \notin E(P'_2)$, or if $u_{g-1} \in S_1$, let $g'$ be the largest index less than $g$ such that $u_{g'} \in S_1 \cup S_2$. Otherwise if $f_{g-1} \in E(P_2')$ and $u_{g-1} \notin S_1$,  let 
